Subject: [PATCH] feat(v2): route bounded negotiated transaction relay
 applications

Maintenance explanation added during mailbox export:
Route negotiated transaction applications through the peer dispatcher and transport with explicit bounded handling. Extend dispatcher tests to verify transaction actions and refusal paths alongside existing peer traffic.

